          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "courtney.dickens@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:52:38 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><b><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Reliable fit. Excellent</span></span></b></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><b><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">&nbsp;</span>strength.</b></span></span></h2>\n<p>Stryker CMF PEEK Customized Implants are designed individually for each patient to replace bony voids in the cranial and craniofacial skeleton. PEEK implants may provide a strong, rigid reconstruction along with anatomical fit and contour.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 15 2025 15:05:50 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "textIsRich": "true"
