          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Apr 29 2025 19:23:49 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">3D Systems VSP<sup>®</sup>&nbsp;solutions</span></span></p>\n<p>For PEEK Single Stage cases, 3D Systems offers surgical marking guides and anatomical models to assist with the craniotomy. Marking guides are available in either a cap or ring style.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Apr 29 2025 21:55:21 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
