          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Navigation</span></span></p>\n<p>Navigation can be integrated into PEEK Single Stage cases. Transfer the planned resection outline to the patient’s bony anatomy using compatible navigation system (STL and DICOM files).</p>\n",
